message: "If you use these examples, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "oofem-examples: reproducible OOFEM analyses"
abstract: "Reproducible OOFEM analyses that accompany blog posts at petergrassl.com. Each folder is a self-contained example with input files, run scripts and a README, run in a published Docker image without compilation."
